@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:——希罗无法顺利完成少女们的魔女化，<br>只有时间徒然往前流动。|#CommonBad10_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这么下去只会<br>无谓地伤害她们而已。|#CommonBad10_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么办。该怎么办？|#CommonBad10_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:几经纠结，最终我……|#CommonBad10_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从怀中取出了药瓶。<br>那是和仪礼剑一同，由梅露露取来的<br>【杀死魔女的药】。|#CommonBad10_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我是以防万一才拿着的……<br>有办法的话，我是真不想用它。|#CommonBad10_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我将药瓶的内容物倾倒在仪礼剑上。|#CommonBad10_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR5,ArmL7
[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你在干什……|#CommonBad10_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ========================================
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_29_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
; ========================================

; ========================================
; グサッと刺さる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_86 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR6,ArmL6,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Lifeless03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Fearful_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Pale01>Pale01_03
[PrintTextModified Text:欸……啊……咕啊……|#CommonBad10_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛惊讶地睁大双眼。|#CommonBad10_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我将涂了药的仪礼剑贯穿了她的胸口。|#CommonBad10_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR6,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Lifeless03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Fearful_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Pale01>Pale01_03
[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……为什么……？|#CommonBad10_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:困惑。悲伤。绝望。<br>各种各样的感情，现于其声，形于其色。<br>我拔出了插在艾玛胸口的剑。|#CommonBad10_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ========================================
; 倒れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_19 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:鲜血染红了审判庭，樱羽艾玛就此殒命。|#CommonBad10_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因我的行动和艾玛的死，少女们喧闹了起来。|#CommonBad10_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.1
[PrintTextModified Text:"（为了拯救大家，我只能……<br>　把大家杀了）|#CommonBad10_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这么一来，就能从大魔女的诅咒中得到解放。|#CommonBad10_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们不会再魔女化。<br>她们不会再失去自我，化作残骸，<br>不再受囚于不死的身体带来的长生之苦。|#CommonBad10_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.2
[PrintTextModified Text:就由我来……拯救你们。|#CommonBad10_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我握紧了沾满艾玛鲜血的剑。|#CommonBad10_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#ff0000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor
; ========================================

; ========================================
; ぐちゃっ、めきなど体を害する音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_10 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
; ========================================
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#FFFFFF Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor

[PrintTextModified Text:有的少女向我投来敌意，破口大骂。|#CommonBad10_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有的少女，只能面对我露出深深的恐惧。|#CommonBad10_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有的少女直言我才是魔女，挺身反抗。|#CommonBad10_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:13_1
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:泪划过了我的脸颊。|#CommonBad10_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时我才终于发现。<br>我的心，在作痛。|#CommonBad10_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，我做到了。<br>我【拯救了】大家。|#CommonBad10_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后我……触犯了自己的禁忌。|#CommonBad10_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我将仪礼剑的刃抵在自己的脖颈上。<br>手在颤抖，呼吸正慌乱。|#CommonBad10_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没事的。这是【救赎】。|#CommonBad10_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我没有做错。|#CommonBad10_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:由我亲手结束一切，这才是正确的。|#CommonBad10_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我下定决心，拉动了手臂。|#CommonBad10_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

